Wed Sep 30 05:43:35 UTC 2026 - Adrian Schröter <adrian@suse.de>

- Initial package of gufo 0.2.0
  Gufo is a local inference engine optimized for AMD Strix Halo
  hardware that enables running large language and text-to-speech
  models directly on your device. It provides a high-performance
  server for seamless AI model serving without relying on cloud
  services.
